          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Sympathy Flowers Auckland Wide</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "template--15859280478387__912a4554-b521-442c-a251-58ff7a8a79c7-16689122917122b8e5-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Thoughtful flowers for a difficult time</h3>"
          }
        },
        "2c15e8d8-a5a1-4023-b620-45f1a9d489f8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When words are hard to find, flowers can we a simple way to reach out and let them know you are thinking of them.</p><p>At Mel's Flower Truck, I can custom make a beautiful, fresh seasonal bouquet - perfect for sending love sympathy and support to friends or family.</p><p>If you're not sure what flowers to choose, don't worry. You can let me choose.</p>"
          }
        },
        "1c523efc-c8e8-4d52-a87c-4b81d40899c7": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, make announcements, or welcome customers to your store.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
